{"product_id":"smok-novo-2x-20w-pod-system","title":"SMOK NOVO 2X 20W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK Novo 2X Pod System, featuring an 800mAh battery, integrated 0.9ohm Meshed Pod, and is compatible with all previous Novo Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"SMOK NOVO 2 Replacement Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-2-replacement-pods\"\u003eNovo 2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the SMOK Novo 2X Kit delivers a slim and portable form-factor, fitting neatly into the pocket, purse, or bookbag. Utilizing two different wattage output schemes, the NOVO 2X Pod System intelligently reads the resistance of the installed pod and outputs the perfect wattage to fully unlock the flavors of your favorite eJuice or nicotine salt. Holding up to 2mL within the refillable pod, the Novo 2X is great for those that are busy or traveling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK Novo 2X Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 97mm by 24.5mm by 14.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 800mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range \u0026lt; 0.7ohm: 12-20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range \u0026gt; 0.7ohm: 4-14W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 3.0-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-2.5ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Control Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK Novo 2X Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.9ohm Meshed MTL Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with Novo, Novo 2, Novo 2S, and Novo 2X Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Novo 2X Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.9ohm Novo 2X Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531768700983,"sku":"69d25d4bc578f","price":3900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_novo_2x_-_pod_system_-_black_cobra.png?v=1741709979","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-2x-20w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




